<title>USA: Marcus adding business class to Budgetel.</title>
<headline>Marcus adding business class to Budgetel.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marcus Corp said Tuesday it will invest more than $2.5 million to convert 10 percent of all Budgetel Inns Inc rooms to business-class status.</p>
<p>Amenities include better lighting, speakerphones, ergonomic chairs and extra-large desks.</p>
<p>Budgetel Inns will become the first major limited-service lodging chain in the country to offer business-class amenities at all locations.</p>
<p>Completion is expected by the end of March, Marcus said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
